{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-06-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'KROGER HEALTH PARTNERS WITH TRAE YOUNG AND TURNER SPORTS TO HELP DRIVE COVID-19 VACCINATIONS IN ATLANTA', 'text': "ATLANTA, JUNE 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KROGER HEALTH, THE HEALTHCARE DIVISION OF THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS WORKING TO ENABLE ATLANTA'S UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES TO HAVE GREATER AWARENESS OF AND ACCESS TO THE COVID-19 VACCINE BY PARTNERING WITH TURNER SPORTS, NBA ON TNT, AND TRAE YOUNG, ALL-STAR GUARD ON THE ATLANTA HAWKS. ACCORDING TO THE CDC, 62% OF ADULTS IN AMERICA HAVE RECEIVED AT LEAST ONE VACCINATION SHOT; HOWEVER, UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES – AND SPECIFICALLY BLACK AND BROWN COMMUNITIES – ARE STILL LAGGING."}